Package: 9router
Version: 0.5.85-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Twilight <twilight@aliveos.org>
Depends: nodejs-lts | nodejs
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/decolua/9router
Description: Free AI coding router with smart fallback
 Local AI model router that connects coding agents (Claude Code, Codex,
 Cline, Muse Code, etc.) to free and paid providers via an OpenAI-compatible
 endpoint. Features smart auto-fallback, provider health checks, and a
 web dashboard at localhost:20128.
